ull cycles, Bitcoin often spearheads the market’s ascent. “Bitcoin rotation” therefore refers to the strategic shift investors take when redirecting their funds from Bitcoin into altcoins . The aim here is that with much smaller market caps at the helm, higher returns are on offer as the altcoin market gains traction in relative unison. This transition sparks “altcoin season,” a phase where alternative cryptocurrencies experience significant price increases and heightened market activity. Within this period, memecoins emerge as the most promising millionaire-making segment of altcoins, as established projects like Dogecoin (DOGE) and Shiba Inu (SHIB) are well-positioned for growth due to their strong communities and widespread recognition, whilst newer memecoins such as 888 (888) and SPX6900 (SPX) attract attention through their innovative meme premises and drastically smaller market caps (which is especially true in the case of the former). It’s only these top memecoins that will experience substantial surges throughout alt season, which is why in the midst of December 2024’s growing altcoin enthusiasm, it’s vital for all aspiring millionaires that they’re aware of which cryptocurrencies are expected to blow up. It’s equally important for traders to understand what makes the best projects, which is why before delving into our list of the next big crypto to explode in 2025, we will explain how we came to our research-based conclusions. Key Characteristics of Cryptocurrencies Poised for Explosive Growth As altcoin season approaches, anyone who’s read the crypto history books will be eyeing-up memecoins as the biggest winners of this multi-billion dollar opportunity. Furthermore, what’s recently emerged is a new train of thought behind why the likes of DOGE, SHIB, and more recently, SPX6900 and 888 have shined brightest within a domain of endless animal and character-based memes. The answer is essentially listed below, as experts and crypto millionaires such as Murad 