and close above 20,000. The S&P 500 rose 1.1%, while the Dow Jones Industrial Average advanced 0.9%. All three major indexes posted gains yesterday after recovering from a shaky morning. Markets will be closed for Christmas tomorrow and will reopen Thursday morning. Tesla ( TSLA ) rose more than 7%, leading the Magnificent Seven stocks higher. Advanced chipmakers Broadcom ( AVGO ) and Advanced Micro Devices ( AMD ) continued to rise after leading the S&P 500 yesterday when each was given a boost by analysts' bullish comments about their artificial intelligence potential. American Airlines ( AAL ) shares recovered from earlier losses after a technical issue forced the carrier to briefly ground all of its flights on one of the busiest travel days of the year. Treasury yields ended Tuesday little changed, with the 10-year yield closing at 4.59%. Yields have risen 20 basis points since the Federal Reserve last week scaled back its forecast for future interest rate cuts. Bitcoin ( BTCUSD ) surged above $98,000 after slipping to $93,000 yesterday. Last week's Fed decision has weighed on the cryptocurrency, which t", timestamp=datetime.datetime(2024, 12, 30, 6, 31, 44, 420681), status='success', summary={'analysis_type': 'general', 'assets': [{'ticker': 'TSLA', 'rating': 'Buy', 'target_price': '750', 'sentiment': 'Bullish', 'catalysts': ['Santa Claus Rally', 'Strong performance among Magnificent Seven stocks'], 'kpis': ['7% increase in stock price', 'Leading performance in the market rally'], 'action': 'Add Long', 'sources': ['Investopedia article']}, {'ticker': 'AVGO', 'rating': 'Buy', 'target_price': '650', 'sentiment': 'Bullish', 'catalysts': ['Bullish analyst comments on AI potential'], 'kpis': ['Continued rise in stock price', 'Leadership in S&P 500 performance'], 'action': 'Add Long', 'sources': ['Investopedia article']}, {'ticker': 'AMD', 'rating': 'Buy', 'target_price': '150', 'sentiment': 'Bullish', 'catalysts': ['Bullish analyst comments on AI potential'], 'kpis'