 weight-loss drug Zepbound to treat sleep apnea. Shares of Palantir ( PLTR ) ticked up 0.2% on the defense contractor's first day as a component of the Nasdaq 100. MicroStrategy ( MSTR ), another new addition to the index, tumbled nearly 9% alongside ", timestamp=datetime.datetime(2024, 12, 30, 6, 37, 46, 723649), status='success', summary={'analysis_type': 'general', 'assets': [{'ticker': 'AVGO', 'rating': 'Buy', 'target_price': '$950', 'sentiment': 'Bullish', 'catalysts': ['Strong quarterly results', 'UBS raised price target'], 'kpis': ['5% stock price increase'], 'action': 'Add Long', 'sources': ['UBS Analyst Report']}, {'ticker': 'NVDA', 'rating': 'Buy', 'target_price': '$600', 'sentiment': 'Bullish', 'catalysts': ['Leading Magnificent Seven stocks', '3% stock price increase'], 'kpis': ['3% stock price increase'], 'action': 'Add Long', 'sources': ['Market Performance Data']}, {'ticker': 'LLY', 'rating': 'Buy', 'target_price': '$700', 'sentiment': 'Bullish', 'catalysts': ['FDA approval of Zepbound weight-loss drug'], 'kpis': ['4% stock price increase'], 'action': 'Add Long', 'sources': ['FDA Approval News']}, {'ticker': 'PLTR', 'rating': 'Hold', 'target_price': '$20', 'sentiment': 'Neutral', 'catalysts': ['First day as a component of the Nasdaq 100'], 'kpis': ['0.2% stock price increase'], 'action': 'Hold', 'sources': ['Nasdaq Inclusion Report']}, {'ticker': 'MSTR', 'rating': 'Sell', 'target_price': '$300', 'sentiment': 'Bearish', 'catalysts': ['9% stock price decline'], 'kpis': ['9% stock price decrease'], 'action': 'Close Long', 'sources': ['Market Performance Data']}], 'macro': {'indicators': ['Federal Reserve interest rate forecast'], 'interest_rates': 'Future interest rate cuts scaled back', 'sentiment': 'Neutral'}}, agent_id='49316f17-a270-415d-a587-2642ae362f14', extraction_method='selenium'), WebSearchResult(url='https://www.cnbc.com/2024/12/10/stock-market-today-live-updates.html', title='Stock market news for Dec. 11, 2024', content='Stock market news f