chanism'], 'kpis': ['Current ICO price: $0.0003659', 'Presale funds raised: $37 million', 'Staking APY: 35%'], 'action': 'Consider adding a small speculative position', 'sources': ['Techpoint Africa', 'Wall Street Pepe Twitter']}, {'ticker': 'SOLX', 'rating': 'Buy', 'target_price': 'N/A (focus on technological adoption)', 'sentiment': 'Bullish', 'catalysts': ['First layer 2 blockchain on Solana', 'Addresses congestion issues on Solana', 'Exposure to Ethereum and Solana ecosystems'], 'kpis': ['Presale funds raised: $6.7 million', 'Solana active users: 4 million in 24 hours', '40% non-vote transaction failure rate on Solana'], 'action': 'Add to portfolio for long-term growth potential', 'sources': ['Techpoint Africa', 'Solaxy Twitter']}, {'ticker': 'Best Wallet Token', 'rating': 'Hold', 'target_price': 'N/A', 'sentiment': 'Neutral', 'catalysts': ['Comprehensive Web3 wallet features', 'Non-custodial wallet with advanced security'], 'kpis': ['Integration of diverse features like crypto debit card and decentralized exchanges'], 'action': 'Monitor for further developments before investing', 'sources': ['Techpoint Africa']}]}, agent_id='dea0087e-2b5b-4735-9f53-f31cbedef15e', extraction_method='selenium'), WebSearchResult(url='https://www.coinbase.com/pt-pt/institutional/research-insights/research/market-intelligence/guide-to-crypto-markets-q4-2024', title='Just a moment...', content='Just a moment... www.coinbase.com Verifying you are human. This may take a few seconds. www.coinbase.com needs to review the security of your connection before proceeding. Verification successful Waiting for www.coinbase.com to respond... Ray ID: 8fc28d056bb924a0 Performance & security by Cloudflare', timestamp=datetime.datetime(2025, 1, 3, 16, 58, 12, 677186), status='success', summary={'analysis_type': 'general', 'assets': []}, agent_id='d4c540ab-f4fc-44b6-8001-9ca32f3b742f', extraction_method='selenium'), WebSearchResult(url='https://www.chaincatcher.com/en/article/2159780', title='2024 Cryptocurrency Investment and Financing Changes: Decoupling of Primary and Secondary Markets, VC Projects Losing Dominance - ChainCatcher', content='2024 Cryptocurrency Investment and Financing Changes: Decoupling of Primary and Secondary Markets, VC Projects Losing Dominance - ChainCatcher English Scan to download Home Article Flash Hot Projects Specials Columns ETF Knowledge Base Calendar Activity Tools DeInsight 2024 2024 Cryptocurrency Investment and Financing Changes: Decoupling of Primary and Secondary Markets, VC Projects Losing Dominance OdailyNews 2024-12-30 10:16:25 Collection The AI sector is shining, with a surge in financing in Q4 2024. Share Scan with WeChat Author: Fu Ruo, Odaily Planet Daily In 2024, the investment and financing heat in the crypto field decoupled from the overall market trend, with VC coins no longer dominating market performance. On a macro level, the crypto market in 2024 welcomed numerous historical moments, including the launch of Bitcoin spot ETFs, the launch of Ethereum spot ETFs, the clarification of regulatory policies in various countries, the Federal Reserve\'s announcement of interest rate cuts, and Trump\'s impending return to the White House, all of which positively impacted the market, leading Bitcoin to successfully break through the important threshold of $100,000. Internally, the crypto market saw meme coins become the focus of attention, with different types of memes at different times serving as boosters for market rallies. VC projects performed poorly, and the linear release cycle of tokens became a chronic "poison" for VC projects. Under the influence of various factors, the number of financing activities in the primary market increased significantly, but the amount of financing was more cautious. Looking back at the investment and financing activities in the primary market in 2024, Odaily Planet Daily found: In 2024, the number of financing activities in the primary market was 1,295, with a disclosed total financing amount of $9.346 billion; The AI sector showed its strength, with a surge in financing activities in Q4 2024; The largest single investment amount was $525 million for Praxis. Note: Odaily Planet Daily categorized all projects disclosed in Q1 based on dimensions such as business type, target audience, and business model into five major tracks: Infrastructure, Applications, Technology Service Providers, Financial Service Providers, and Other Service Providers. Each track is further divided into different sub-sectors, including GameFi, DeFi, NFT, Payments, Wallets, DAO, Layer 1, Cross-chain, and others. In 2024, it belongs to BTC and meme coins An overview of the primary market financing situation over the past three years leads to an important conclusion: The investment and financing activities in the primary market in 2024 have gradually decoupled from the overall trends of the crypto market, with market conditions primarily driven by Bitcoin and meme sectors, while traditional VC projects performed poorly and could no longer serve as the core driving force of the market. From data analysis, 2022 was the peak period of the previous crypto market cycle, with primary market financing activities highly active, and the changes in quantity and amount almost synchronized with market conditions. In Q1 2022, the number of financing activities reached 562, with an amount as high as $12.677 billion. However, as the market entered a downward cycle, financing activities rapidly contracted, with only 330 financing activities remaining in Q4, and the amount dropping to $3.375 billion. 2023 continued the bear market effect, with financing activities in the primary market and the overall market performing poorly. The number and amount of financing continued to decline throughout the year, dropping to 232 and $1.725 billion in Q3, marking a nearly three-year low. During this phase, the primary market was significantly affected by the overall market trends, with market sentiment and capital activity both suppressed. 2024 became an important turning point for investment and financing activities in the primary market. Data shows', timestamp=datetime.datetime(2025, 1, 3, 16, 58, 16, 527761), status='success', summary={'analysis_type': 'macro', 'assets': [], 'sector': {'name': 'Cryptocurrency Investment and Financing', 'sentiment': 'Mixed', 'catalysts': ['Decoupling of primary and secondary markets', 'Poor performance of VC projects', 'Rise of Bitcoin and meme coins'], 'kpis': ['1,295 financing activities in 2024', 'Total financing amount of $9.346 billion', 'Largest single investment of $525 million for Praxis'], 'top_assets': ['Bitcoin breaking through $100,000', 'Ethereum spot ETF launch'], 'recommendation': 'Overweight AI and meme sectors, cautious on traditional VC projects', 'sources': ['Odaily Planet Daily', 'ChainCatcher']}, 'macro': {'indicators': ['Launch of Bitcoin and Ethereum spot ETFs', 'Clarification of regulatory policies', 'Federal Reserve interest rate cuts', "Trump's return to the White House"], 'interest_rates': 'Federal Reserve has announced interest rate cuts', 'global_factors': "Trump's impending return to the White House", 'sentiment': 'Bullish'}}, agent_id='d3ee7f78-d336-483b-a82c-2f73003c916b', extraction_method='selenium'), WebSearchResult(url='https://get.glassnode.com/guide-to-crypto-markets-q4/', title='https://get.glassnode.com/guide-to-crypto-markets-q4/', content='', timestamp=datetime.datetime(2025, 1, 3, 16, 58, 19, 34352), status='success', summary={'analysis_type': 'general', 'assets': []}, agent_id='eae53ff0-7cd5-4c5c-81ff-26790dada06f', extraction_method='selenium'), WebSearchResult(url='https://www.acuiti.io/crypto-derivatives-management-insight-report-q4-2024-2/', title='https://www.acuiti.io/crypto-derivatives-management-insight-report-q4-2024-2/', content='', timestamp=datetime.datetime(2025, 1, 3, 16, 58, 23, 107004), status='success', summary={'analysis_type': 'sector', 'assets': [], 'sector': {'name':