 in this volatile sector. Analysts now predict meme coins will remain central to crypto’s evolution, with new projects offering scalability and cross-chain compatibility set to lead the next wave of adoption. Solaxy Raises $7.7M—Could It Lead Solana’s Meme Coin Market in 2025? Among the newest contenders in the meme coin space, Solaxy ($SOLX) has captured investor attention, raising $7.7 million in its presale. As the first Layer-2 solution built specifically for Solana, Solaxy aims to solve network congestion while creating a fast, scalable platform for decentralized applications and meme coin trading. GET IN EARLY—JOIN THE SOLAXY PRESALE NOW The presale for $SOLX has gained momentum as early investors look to secure tokens at $0.001588 before prices rise. With each funding milestone, the token’s value increases, rewarding early adopters and generating excitement ahead of its exchange listing in 2025. Solaxy Offers Scalability and Ethereum Liquidity Solaxy’s approach combines scalability with cross-chain compatibility, allowing it to leverage Ethereum’s $65 billion liquidity while enhancing Solana’s transaction speeds. This dual-blockchain framework positions Solaxy as a bridge between two leading networks, unlocking liquidity while solving Solana’s congestion issues. By processing transactions off-chain before finalizing them on Solana, Solaxy reduces network strain and lowers fees, making it easier for meme coins and decentralised finance (DeFi) applications to scale. This infrastructure could make Solaxy the go-to platform for developers and traders navigating Solana’s fast-growing ecosystem. The project’s focus on efficiency has drawn comparisons to Shibarium, which helped transform Shiba Inu into a utility-driven platform. Analysts believe Solaxy could follow a similar path, combining meme coin appeal with tangible utility to sustain long-term growth. Investors See 100x Potential in Solaxy Crypto analysts have taken notice of Solaxy’s rapid presale growth. Jac